(
    title: "Commando Raid",
    description: Some("Android paratroopers spill from helicopters over your city while you swing an anti-aircraft gun to shoot them out of the sky — three landings level a building, captured rooftops let the androids tunnel toward your gun, and a bomber\'s single devastating bomb has to be shot down mid-fall. Every 10,000 points rings a bell and rebuilds your worst-hit building, and the console switches choose steerable missiles over straight bullets, automatic fire, and whether the bomber flies at all."),
